  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into rounds.\n• Cut sweet potato and beetroot into small chunks.\n• Cut brown onion into thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d24fb4d1132925101cfe3-cef330b2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d24fb4d1132925101cfe3-1969acb3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain and cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• In the last minute of cook time, add the honey, turning haloumi to coat.\n• To tray with roasted veggies, add mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Gently toss to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d24fb4d1132925101cfe3-0a45e37b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide chermoula veggie toss between bowls.\n• Top with honey haloumi.\n• Drizzle over garlic aioli and sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d24fb4d1132925101cfe3-38ac5168.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
